lor: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">类别</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课时间</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课模式</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">备注</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 57.5pt;"><td rowspan="2" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第一轮次</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">方案内课程</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月10日13:00～11日10:30</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">正选</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">2026级已预置必修课程，方案内课程已推荐班级，可志愿退改，退改即刻生效。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 29.45pt;"><td style="display: none; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通识选修课</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月10日13:00～11日10:30</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">预选</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; background-color: inherit; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通识教育选修课为志愿选课，规定时段均可选课，随机抽签决定中签学生。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 29.45pt;"><td rowspan="2" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">第二轮次</span></p></td><td colspan="2" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月11日11点</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">公布抽签</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通识选修课</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 39.6pt;"><td style="display: none; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">方案+通识</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">9月11日13:00～12日14:00</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">正选</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">即选即得</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二、具体说明及要求</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1、方案内课程。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">已为学生预置必修课选课结果（不含英语分级课程及大学体育）。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">同一课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">有多个推荐教学班的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">在对应教学班中调换，调整即刻生效，课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">限定课容量</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。学生需根据培养方案要求和个人情况进行选课，为即选即得模式，限制时间冲突，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">实</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">查看个人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课结果</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2、通识教育选修课。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">普通本科学生本科期间至少选修8学分并覆盖5个模块（人文禀赋、审美情操、社会责任、科学思维、世界格局，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">其中“人文禀赋”和“审美情操”各不少于2学分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）。通识教育选修课选课分为预选、正选两个批次：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: Calibri; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">①</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">预选阶段为志愿选课模式，学生可选五个志愿，若同一课堂第一志愿超出课容量，则随机抽签决定中签学生，预选结果将于9月11日11时公布，学生可在个人课表中查看。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">②</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">正选阶段为即选即得模式，学生依据预选结果，按个人情况进行课程补改选，限制时间冲突，选课受课容量限制，退改即刻生效。为了保障学习效果，</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2026级学生限选2门。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3、大学英语课程</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（2026级）</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">按照英语分级教学规定执行</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（附件2）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，根据入学测试英语成绩选择对应级别课程，成绩</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">大于等于75分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">的学生可选择高级班、中级班、普通班进行修读，成绩</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">小于75分且大于63.5分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">的学生可选择中级班、普通班进行修读，成绩</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">小于等于63.5分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">的学生选择普通班进行修读。选课结束后，按照选课结果确定学生分级级别</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学生确定分级后不得再更改</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，以后学期须按对应级别修读相应课程。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">实验班学生修读《创新大学英语》系列课程，退出实验班学生按普通班修读相应课程。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4、大学体育课程</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（2026级）</span><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">请依据《西安电子科技大学体育俱乐部学生入会条件》（附件3），做好自我评定，挑选级别合适的俱乐部。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三、其他补充事项</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">严格按照规定时间和选课要求进行选课。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各教学单位密切关注学生选课进度，提醒学生按时选课，确保所有学生知晓此次选课安排；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">仔细查阅个人培养方案，不遗漏相关课程。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">未选课的学生不允许参加教学活动，选课学生不按规定参加教学活动的，其成绩一律作零分处理；必修课未选漏</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选的，在各项排名时按“零分”计算；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.请各位同学密切关注教务处主页最新通知（</span><span class="docx_12" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">http://jwc.xidian.edu.cn</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）并于选课结束后及时查看个人课表（部分课程未安排时间地点的，在课程列表右侧展示）；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4.选课期间存在疑问的学生请咨询所在学院/新生书院，具体联系方式见附件1。选课地址为：http://xk.xidian.edu.cn，账号密码若有遗忘、错误等问题请咨询信息网络技术中心029-88201650。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件：1、各单位选课负责老师联系方式（见下页）</span></p><p class="docx-num-0-255" style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 80pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2、大学英语分级教学实施方案（单独下载）</span></p><p class="docx-num-0-255" style="min-hei